WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.853
Storage type is an engineering decision Identifiers
can use text

00:00:06.064 --> 00:00:11.710
UUID or integer keys depending on the system Counts
use

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:17.687
integer types Currency often uses exact NUMERIC
storage Dates

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:23.219
and event times should use temporal types The
important idea is that the

00:00:23.246 --> 00:00:29.362
database representation should support the meaning
and quality rules of the data A

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:34.033
technically valid storage type is not enough if it
encourages incorrect interpretation
